From 59e7e531be9351bcc7ab30d4bb4699d63f894985 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:56:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] A storm of cuts in turning directions: PlayUnitFlurry, for
 Bladestorm

PlayUnitFlurry(unit, seconds, from, cuts, cutSeconds, windupSeconds, finish, finishSeconds,
turnDegrees, trail, trailMs) plays cut after cut from another model's clips through
PlayUnitAnimation's own path, each cutSeconds long, the first wound up over windupSeconds (the
anticipation), the body snapping turnDegrees a step round its feet to face a new way for each
(ahead, right, left, further right, further left, and round again), each trailing the weapons
it holds; when the time is up or StopUnitAnimation ends it, one wider finishing sweep as the
body comes back to face ahead. A tilt can now be a Turn (about the feet, snapping round and
holding). HasActionCombat() is 17.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
